- All 15 local certificates and 10 small-ring energy intervals passed independent integer verification. Random d=3 searches reached iteration limits; their lower bounds remain certified, but optimality is unproved.

The remaining spectral lemma is an upper bound on the infrared-filtered inverse moment, which would give \(A\le24\pi K M f(d)\). A paired ring-certificate bound would instead give \(A\le(4K/\pi)M f(d)\). Modular bootstrap still needs quantitative field-counting and support lemmas.

